v4.0 — STANDALONE VERSION

---

# 0. SESSION PARAMETERS (filled by the user at START)

```text
DATA WINDOW: [start date] to [end date]
OUTPUT LANGUAGE: summary = English; export block and scout state = English
OWNER BASELINE: [previous regime / PM carry / open questions /
